  deployed 0.765 ly out, 29,979→4,000 km/s over 24.7 yr; fusion reserve
  finishes capture. New MAGSAIL + CAPTURE phases; all transit totals
  recomputed (Proxima 45.2→63.6 yr, Tau Ceti 121.9→140.2).
- Torch burn stretched 0.05→2.0 yr (jet power 34 PW→0.9 TW; radiators
  1,200 km²→34 km²). Sundiver/Oberth considered and rejected — Oberth
  does nothing for multi-year burns; the Jovian flyby's real job is the
  115.8° asymptote bend.
- Relativistic plate: ship proper time τ=∫dt/γ, β, Sol-beacon Doppler
  (8.4 GHz → 7.60 GHz at cruise), LY-range formatting.
- Whipple erosion budget: v³-weighted dose, τ=300 yr → margin telemetry.

