  <0.75 M☉ stars carry quarantine doctrine; bio-cabinet on the science
  lander resolves it (+2) or not (−6). Flare class now gates oxygen.
- Albedo 0.3 + 33√p greenhouse (Earth = +15 °C exactly); HZ worlds now
  span −40..+32 °C on their own.

Blueprint REV E → REV F:
- Droplet-curtain radiators with drafting breaks (34 km² @ 1,450 K),
  magsail drum on the forward spine, torpor bay telemetry.

QA: tsc clean, build clean, runtime assertions pass, verify-revf.ts +
